wers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/funkysandwich/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/funkysandwich/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/funkysandwich/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/funkysandwich/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/funkysandwich/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/funkysandwich/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/funkysandwich/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/funkysandwich/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-06T00:12:41Z","updated_at":"2025-06-06T00:15:53Z","body":"> [@funkysandwich](https://github.com/funkysandwich) Can you reproduce this on earlier versions of Godot? Like 4.4.1-stable and previous 4.5 dev snapshots?\n\nI did some more testing, and I was able to reproduce the black screen in:\n- 4.5.dev4\n- 4.5.dev3\n- 4.5.dev2\n\nBut not within 4.5.dev1\n\nI ran into this bug after opening a copy of an existing project I started in Godot 4.4.1 with 4.5.dev5.\nIt is a VR project with VRS mode set to XR.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2947140890/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2956615603","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107183#issuecomment-2956615603","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107183","id":2956615603,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6wOl-z","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-09T18:35:14Z","updated_at":"2025-06-09T18:35:14Z","body":"Just given the timeline, this could be related to PR https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99551 which was merged between 4.5-dev1 and dev2, and affects the VRS code","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2956615603/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2963463673","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107183#issuecomment-2963463673","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107183","id":2963463673,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6wot35","user":{"login":"NetroScript","id":18115780,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MTE1Nzgw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18115780?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NetroScript","html_url":"https://github.com/NetroScript","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NetroScript/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NetroScript/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NetroScript/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NetroScript/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NetroScript/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NetroScript/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NetroScript/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NetroScript/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NetroScript/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-11T16:26:26Z","updated_at":"2025-06-11T16:26:26Z","body":"I also encountered the same issue on my system and can confirm that it is caused by #99551.\n\nI took a look at the code diff and debugged it on my system.\n\nThe aforementioned PR refactored the code and removed a property of the framebuffer storing the VRS attachment index ([link](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99551/files#diff-6a0ba0d55e06e0b8fe08ef1ffad431d59267ca385ad827beaf31f45860365774L459)), in the same process an if-else statement was removed ([link](https://github.com/DarioSamo/godot/blob/808c9fbcc54a90e219b6b0139f0b311adc483054/servers/rendering/rendering_device.cpp#L2815-L2816)) which previously set this now removed property. This property was replaced with method parameters in other places. However the removal of the if condition causes the VRS attachment to be added to the color_attachments list. \n\nThis list gets iterated, and for every attachment in the list, the `attachment_last_pass` is set - this now includes the VRS attachment. \n\nWhich in return causes the `ERR_FAIL_COND_V_MSG(attachment_last_pass[attachment] == i, RDD::RenderPassID(), \"Invalid framebuffer VRS attachment(\" + itos(attachment) + \"), in pass (\" + itos(i) + \"), it already was used for something else before in this pass.\");` to trigger in turn causing all of these errors.\n\nRestoring the original if branch (even leaving it empty) with for example:\n\n```c++\n\t\telse if (texture && (texture->usage_flags & TEXTURE_USAGE_VRS_ATTACHMENT_BIT)) {\n\t\t\t\t// Prevent the VRS attachment from being added to the color attachments.\n\t\t}\n```\n\nfixed the specific issue for me. \n\nIf you want I can also create a PR. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2963463673/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2964644227","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107183#issuecomment-2964644227","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107183","id":2964644227,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6wtOGD","user":{"login":"DarioSamo","id":538504,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODUwNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/538504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo","html_url":"https://github.com/DarioSamo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-12T00:44:44Z","updated_at":"2025-06-12T00:44:44Z","body":"> If you want I can also create a PR.\n\nI think you found the issue correctly already although I'll need to refresh my memory on it first. Go ahead and feel free to ping me on it!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2964644227/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]